OL,3,GNEWSAAngry scenes and protests at
OL,4,ASenedd as Reform call for ban on Muslim
OL,5,Aface coverings
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere were bad-tempered and dramatic
OL,8,Fexchanges in the Senedd on Wednesday
OL,9,Fnight as members of Reform called for
OL,10,FMuslim religious face coverings, such
OL,11,Fas the burka, to be banned.
OL,13,FPoliticians from the party said they
OL,14,Fwere "anti-British", allowed Muslim
OL,15,Fwomen to hide their identities and
OL,16,Fsuggested they represented an "alien
OL,17,Fculture".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
