OL,3,GNEWSAAngry scenes and protests at
OL,4,ASenedd as Reform call for ban on Muslim
OL,5,Aface coverings
OL,6,
OL,7,FPlaid Cymru and Labour politicians
OL,8,Fresponded with disdain - Deputy First
OL,9,FMinister Sioned Williams raised the
OL,10,FNuremberg Laws of 1930s Germany and how
OL,11,Fthey led to the extermination of Jews.
OL,13,FThe Muslim Council of Wales described
OL,14,F"disturbingly authoritarian attitudes"
OL,15,F- Reform's Jason O'Connell accused the
OL,16,Fgroup of trying to "silence" the
OL,17,Fdebate.
